    "summary": "Model coffin made of wood in the form of a catfish. Painted in acrylic paint in green, white, brown and black. Catfish has four side fins, two dorsal fins, single long fin on belly and a tail. Three pairs of maxillary barbels and one pair of nasal? barbels. Body and tail curve round slightly. Centre back of catfish has a rectangular cavity with single, metal-hinged wooden lid. Catfish supported on blue painted trapezoidal form which is attached to rectangular black painted base.",
